[ 0 [ MAX ] FOLD ] 'E2A.MAXOF' DEF
[ NOT 'EB' BIND NOT EB AND NOT ] 'E2A.OR' DEF
[ G0D.RUNS [ 'ER' BIND ER 0 GET ER LENGTH 2 COLLECT ] MAP ] 'E2A.RLE' DEF
[ 'EV' BIND EV EV G0D.SHIFT SUB 0 GT 0 [ 'EF' BIND 'EA' BIND EA 1 ADD 1 EF SELECT ] SCAN E2A.MAXOF ] 'E2A.UPRUNS' DEF
[ G0D.RUNS [ 0 GET ] MAP ] 'E2A.DEDUPE' DEF
[ UNIQUE SORT -2 GET 'ES' BIND NIL ES ES NIL? SELECT ] 'E2A.SECOND' DEF
[ 'EV' BIND EV TALLY 'ET' BIND ET U1D.TOPKEY 'EK' BIND EK NIL ET EK GET 2 MUL EV LENGTH GT SELECT ] 'E2A.MAJORITY' DEF
[ 'EN' BIND 1 EN RANGE [ G0D.DIVISORS LENGTH 2 EQ ] FILTER ] 'E2A.PRIMES' DEF
[ 'EN' BIND 0 EN 1 ADD RANGE [ 'EK' BIND 2 EK POW ] MAP REVERSE 'EP' BIND EN EP DIV FLOOR 'EQQ' BIND EQQ EQQ 2 DIV FLOOR 2 MUL SUB EP [ EN GT NOT ] FILTER LENGTH -1 MUL TAKE STR JOIN ] 'E2A.BINARY' DEF
[ 'EN' BIND 1 EN 10 MUL 200 ADD RANGE EN [ 'EI' BIND 'EV' BIND 1 EV 2 DIV EV 3 MUL 1 ADD EV 2 DIV FLOOR 2 MUL EV EQ SELECT EV 1 EQ SELECT ] SCAN 'ES' BIND EN 1 COLLECT ES CONCAT [ 1 EQ NOT ] FILTER LENGTH ] 'E2A.COLLATZ' DEF
[ 1 SUB 'EM' BIND EM EM 9 DIV FLOOR 9 MUL SUB 1 ADD ] 'E2A.DIGROOT' DEF
[ 'EN' BIND 1 EN RANGE [ 1 1 ] [ 'EI' BIND 'EA' BIND EA EA -1 GET EA -2 GET ADD 1 COLLECT CONCAT ] FOLD ] 'E2A.FIBS' DEF
[ 'EN' BIND EN E2A.FIBS [ EN LT ] FILTER LENGTH 1 ADD ] 'E2A.FIBINDEX' DEF
[ CHARS [ 'EC' BIND 1 -1 EC '(' EQ EC '[' EQ E2A.OR SELECT ] MAP 0 [ ADD 0 MAX ] SCAN E2A.MAXOF ] 'E2A.BRDEPTH' DEF
[ 'ES' BIND 0 ES CHARS LENGTH 2 DIV FLOOR RANGE ES [ 'EI' BIND '()' '' REPLACE '[]' '' REPLACE ] FOLD ] 'E2A.BRREDUCE' DEF
[ E2A.BRREDUCE '' EQ ] 'E2A.BALANCED' DEF
[ CHARS 'EC' BIND 0 EC LENGTH RANGE [ 'EL' BIND EC EL TAKE JOIN E2A.BALANCED ] FILTER E2A.MAXOF ] 'E2A.BALPREFIX' DEF
[ E2A.BRREDUCE CHARS LENGTH ] 'E2A.UNMATCHED' DEF
[ [ NIL? NOT ] FILTER ] 'E2A.PRESENT' DEF
[ 'EP' BIND EP 0 [ ADD ] FOLD EP LENGTH DIV ] 'E2A.MEAN' DEF
[ E2A.PRESENT E2A.MEAN ] 'E2A.PMEAN' DEF
[ 'EV' BIND EV EV E2A.PRESENT 0 GET [ 'EX' BIND 'EA' BIND EA EX EX NIL? SELECT ] SCAN ] 'E2A.FILLED' DEF
[ [ NIL? ] MAP ] 'E2A.MISSING' DEF
[ E2A.MISSING 'EM' BIND FALSE 1 COLLECT EM -1 DROP CONCAT NOT EM AND [ ] FILTER LENGTH ] 'E2A.GAPCOUNT' DEF
[ E2A.MISSING 0 [ 'EF' BIND 'EA' BIND EA 1 ADD 0 EF SELECT ] SCAN E2A.MAXOF ] 'E2A.LONGGAP' DEF
[ 'EV' BIND EV 1 DROP EV -1 DROP DIV ] 'E2A.RATIOS' DEF
[ 'EV' BIND EV E2A.PRESENT 'EP' BIND EV EP EP 0 GET [ MAX ] FOLD DIV ] 'E2A.SCALED' DEF
[ G0C.ORDERS [ 'price' HAS? ] FILTER [ 'EO' BIND EO 'qty' GET EO 'price' GET MUL ] MAP 0 [ ADD ] FOLD ] 'E2A.REVENUE' DEF
[ G0C.ORDERS 'EO' BIND EO [ 'sku' GET ] MAP EO [ 'qty' GET ] MAP GROUP 'EG' BIND EG KEYS EG VALUES [ 0 [ ADD ] FOLD ] MAP RECORD ] 'E2A.QTYBY' DEF
[ G0C.ORDERS [ 'price' HAS? NOT ] FILTER [ 'sku' GET ] MAP UNIQUE ] 'E2A.UNPRICED' DEF
[ G0C.ORDERS [ 'tags' HAS? ] FILTER [ 'tags' GET UNIQUE ] MAP FLATTEN TALLY ] 'E2A.TAGCOUNTS' DEF
[ LOWER G0D.WORDS ] 'E2A.LWORDS' DEF
[ CHARS 'EC' BIND EC 0 GET UPPER EC 1 DROP JOIN LOWER 2 COLLECT JOIN ] 'E2A.CAP' DEF
'x Y y X'
E2A.LWORDS UNIQUE SORT G0A.UNWORDS
